# AV Design Studio Portfolio

A premium portfolio website for an architectural and interior design studio.

## Features

- Luxury studio homepage
- Interior and exterior project gallery
- Like, share, and comment interaction on project cards
- Creator upload dashboard for adding new design content
- About, services, and contact pages
- Responsive modern layout

## Stack

- Next.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

## Getting started

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open http://localhost:3000

## Notes

The upload dashboard stores new projects in the browser's localStorage so you can test the creator upload workflow without a backend.














